# Architecture (5 layers)

Follow `docs/AI-deployment/ARCHITECTURE.md` (or relocated kit path).

```
app.py / pages/     # entry + multi-page
src/utils/          # L1 infrastructure
src/core/           # L2 domain (no Streamlit, no DB)
src/db/             # L3 data access
src/services/       # L4 orchestration
src/ui/             # L5 presentation components
```

Import only downward: `ui → services → db → core → utils`.

- UI must not own algorithms or DB writes.
- Domain must not import Streamlit.
- One clear responsibility per module.
